@startuml sequence-login
title Login flow — obtaining a JWT

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Client
participant "Gateway\n:9000" as GW
participant "Auth Service\n:9001" as Auth
participant "Keycloak\n:8081" as KC

Client -> GW : POST /api/auth/login\n{ email, password }
note right of GW : /api/auth/login is permitAll
GW -> Auth : route lb://auth-service
Auth -> KC : POST /realms/auth-management/.../token\ngrant_type=password\nclient_id=platform-client\nscope=openid roles
KC --> Auth : 200 { access_token (JWT), refresh_token, ... }
note right of KC : JWT claims:\n realm_access.roles\n resource_access.platform-client.roles
Auth --> GW : 200 token response
GW --> Client : 200 token response

@enduml
